# A guest reaches for another guest's throw that passes far from her: out of reach on her own world,
# the grab claims nothing. The box flies on under the thrower and lands, and nothing comes of the
# reach. A claim she sends anyway is refused by the host's evidence (test_body_sync_claims: a far
# catch).
scenario catch_miss
scene four_chars_item
seed 51
guests 2
settle 6s

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 10ms loss 1%
net g2 rtt 100ms jitter 10ms loss 1%

p1 grab box as lift
p1 wait 300ms
p1 throw -1 0.2 4 speed 9 as throw
# The flight's middle: the box is 4 m and more from her.
at 900ms p2 grab box as catch

expect result lift granted
expect result throw done
expect result catch failed
expect moved box >= 2m
expect agree_at_rest 5cm
expect no_stuck
expect effects_once
expect late_drops.count <= 0
expect takes.count <= 0
